.TH XD\-PRINTERS 1 2026-10-18 XeonDesktop "XeonDesktop Manual"
.SH NAME
xd\-printers \- Printers and Faxes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.SY xd\-printers
.RB [ \-\-queue
.IR name " |"
.B \-\-properties
.IR name " |"
.B \-\-preferences
.IR name " |"
.BR \-\-add ]
.YS
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xd\-printers
is Windows XP's Printers and Faxes folder, on CUPS: the printers the
scheduler has, the default one with XP's check mark.
It opens a printer's queue, Properties and Printing Preferences, prints
test pages, pauses and deletes printers, and adds network printers with
the Add Printer Wizard.
Changes go through the CUPS scheduler's own authorization, which may ask
for a password.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-queue " name"
Only the queue of the printer
.IR name .
.TP
.BI \-\-properties " name"
Only its Properties.
.TP
.BI \-\-preferences " name"
Only its Printing Preferences.
.TP
.B \-\-add
Only the Add Printer Wizard.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show a summary of the options and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B CUPS_SERVER
The CUPS scheduler to use, as for every CUPS program.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR lpstat (1),
.BR lpadmin (8),
.BR xd\-control (1)
